{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "294856bd-c9a8-81d1-a0c2-b4235797dbe6",
  "created_at": "2026-03-02T12:22:12-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nicholas Grasso",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosa Delgado",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T12:15:46-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Rosa. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T12:15:53-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello, good afternoon. My name is Nicholas Grasso. I am calling about the noise, the construction noise, in the morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T12:16:05-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Mr. Grasso. Where is the construction? Is it near you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T12:16:12-05:00",
      "duration": 29,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, it is next to me. I live at 436 Bacheller Street, in the Fifth Ward. The crew is next door, they are doing some work on the house, and they start before seven. No way, before seven in the morning, with the hammers and the truck going beep beep beep."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T12:16:41-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Before seven, okay. Do you know about what time they actually start?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T12:16:48-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Today was maybe ten minutes to seven. Friday was the same, and Saturday also, I think a little later Saturday. So is three days now, three days they do this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T12:17:05-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So Friday, Saturday, and today, Monday. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T12:17:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, Friday, Saturday and today. Three days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T12:17:16-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And is it a house they're renovating, or a new build, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T12:17:26-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I think is renovation. They have the ladder, the saw, a big truck in the street. I don't know exactly, I am only the neighbor. I rent here, I don't know the owner next door."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T12:17:46-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, you don't need to know. I can take down the complaint with the address and the times."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T12:17:57-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. And I want to ask, what are the quiet hours? What time is allowed to start, and what time they must stop? Because maybe I am wrong and is allowed, I don't know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T12:18:17-05:00",
      "duration": 39,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Hang on one second, let me make sure I give you the right thing. [pause] Okay. Generally in the city, construction noise isn't supposed to start in the early morning hours, and seven is usually the line for weekdays. Weekends tend to be later. I don't want to tell you an exact weekend time from memory, so I'll have the inspections office confirm it for you when they call back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T12:18:56-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, okay. So seven on weekdays. And today they start before seven, so is not good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T12:19:06-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, if it was ten to seven today, that's earlier than they should be. And Saturday would be even more of a concern."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T12:19:19-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, Saturday also. Exactly, no way they can do Saturday so early."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T12:19:26-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, one moment. [pause] No, no, amor, not on the table, on the paper. Sorry, my granddaughter is here, she is drawing on the back of an envelope. Is okay, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T12:19:44-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all right. Let me get your phone number so someone can call you back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T12:19:53-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, is 401-555-0163."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T12:19:56-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0163. And that's a landline?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T12:20:00-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, landline, at home. I am here most of the day, so you can call anytime."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T12:20:10-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. So I have Nicholas Grasso, 436 Bacheller Street, construction next door starting before seven on Friday, Saturday, and today. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T12:20:24-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, correct. Is exactly that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T12:20:28-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do you know if there's a permit sign posted at the house next door, or a contractor's name on the truck?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T12:20:40-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hmm. The truck has a name on the door, but is a little far and I don't see good. I can look tomorrow, if you need."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T12:20:55-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If you happen to see it, great, but it's not required. The office can find the permit by the address."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T12:21:07-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. So what happens now? Somebody goes there and tells them to stop?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T12:21:16-05:00",
      "duration": 28,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll send this to the right office, and they'll follow up on the complaint. I can't tell you exactly when someone will be out there, but you'll get a call back, and if it starts early again tomorrow, you can call us again and we'll add it to the record."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T12:21:44-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Tomorrow I call again if they do. No problem."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T12:21:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works. Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T12:21:56-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Thank you very much, you are very fast and clear."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T12:22:05-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Grasso. Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T12:22:09-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, bye bye."
    }
  ],
